# "During your turn, this Spacecraft and creatures you control have hexproof" (CR 611.3a, 613.1f, 702.11b): the Raider
# itself is covered whether or not the striation has made it a creature, and every creature its controller controls is
# covered while it is that player's turn. The opposing Raider and creature are not. Fiery Impulse (CR 702.11b) is what
# shows it: Bot1's creature is not a legal target while Bot1's turn is the active one and becomes one once the turn has
# passed, while Bot2's own creature is targetable throughout - hexproof never stops its controller.
[Bot1 Deck]
K'Vort-Class Raider
Grizzly Bears
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Fiery Impulse
Island
Island
Island x8
[Bot2 Deck]
K'Vort-Class Raider
Grizzly Bears
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Fiery Impulse
Island
Island
Island x8
